<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-2" id="letters-container">
  <div class="skeleton h-40" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="skeleton h-40" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>
<div class="empty-state hidden" id="letters-empty">
  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">
    mark_email_unread
  </span>
  <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant" data-empty-text>
    回廊里还没有公开的信笺，不如由你写下第一封。
  </p>
  <a class="btn-primary mt-1" href="#guestbook-form-panel">
    投递第一封
  </a>
</div>

<div class="mt-6 flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 border-t border-line pt-6 sm:flex-row">
  <button class="btn-secondary" data-load-more="">
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">
      unfold_more
    </span>
    <span data-load-more-label>展开更早的信笺</span>
  </button>
  <button class="btn-ghost" data-fish="">
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">
      stream
    </span>
    打捞一只匿名心事
  </button>
</div>
